26:["$","p","p-7",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Target leakage"}]," occurs when a feature contains the answer or information unavailable at prediction time. In our example, including “assigned team after escalation” may make accuracy look extraordinary. ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"Duplicate leakage"}]," occurs when the same case, or near-identical copies, appear across splits. ",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"Process leakage"}]," can arise when labels and features were both influenced by a prior routing rule; the model may simply learn that rule's historical bias."]}]
27:["$","p","p-8",{"children":"Build a small data card before training:"}]
28:["$","table","table-0",{"children":[["$","thead","thead-0",{"children":["$","tr","tr-0",{"children":[["$","th","th-0",{"children":"Field"}],["$","th","th-1",{"children":"Question to record"}]]}]}],["$","tbody","tbody-0",{"children":[["$","tr","tr-0",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Source and consent"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Where did these records come from, and may they be used for this purpose?"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-1",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Prediction-time availability"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Is this field present before routing?"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-2",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Missingness"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Which users or channels lack it?"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-3",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Label policy"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Who assigned the answer, and can it be wrong?"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-4",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Split unit"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Customer, incident, time, or individual ticket?"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-5",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Retention"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"When should raw text and derived features be deleted?"}]]}]]}]]}]
